      "content": "i dont even know why i'm talking to you. i just... i did something at work. a mistake. but it wasn't just a typo or a wrong calculation. i actually ruined someone's life. i saw the fallout today and i just feel like i'm a poison. like i'm just a fundamentally bad person and everything i touch eventually just breaks or gets hurt. it doesnt feel like something i can just \"fix\" or \"learn from.\" it feels like who i am.",
